        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>TBAABaseNodeSummary</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::TBAAVerifier::TBAABaseNodeSummary</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Cache of TBAA base nodes that have already been visited. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This cachce maps a node that has been visited to a pair (IsInvalid, BitWidth) where</para>
<para><computeroutput>IsInvalid</computeroutput> is true iff the node is invalid. <computeroutput>BitWidth</computeroutput>, if non-zero, is the bitwidth of the integer used to denoting the offset of the access. If zero, only a zero offset is allowed.</para>
<para><computeroutput>BitWidth</computeroutput> has no meaning if <computeroutput>IsInvalid</computeroutput> is true. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
